                        "source_sense_id": "629aa924-8806-33a5-a5f8-bd58c433c61c",
                        "target_lang_word": "superprofit",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "superprofit",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4a5e29e9-8e17-30ae-b9df-94082163e994",
                                        "entry_id": "4056350d-6b4a-3a4f-94d5-fb2f73220728",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "excess profit"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "640dedaa-bebd-4ad4-9fe2-aa425ff26549",
                                                "sense_id": "4a5e29e9-8e17-30ae-b9df-94082163e994",
                                                "text": "Our next step will be to understand how the basic economic law of capitalism works under imperialism, and how monopoly superprofits are extracted from imperialism's \"third world\" periphery."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "12f2ad35-9272-421d-a947-801612674312",
                                                "sense_id": "4a5e29e9-8e17-30ae-b9df-94082163e994",
                                                "text": "Obviously, out of such enormous superprofits (since they are obtained over and above the profits which capitalists squeeze out of the workers of their 'own' country) it is possible to bribe the labour leaders[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "339be193-c1d3-47c3-9ecb-518cf092b055",
                        "source_entry_id": "a9fd363c-3a5b-369a-a15c-4c7c1d70485f",
                        "source_sense_id": "629aa924-8806-33a5-a5f8-bd58c433c61c",
                        "target_lang_word": "excess profit",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f117009a-2a58-469c-bfe9-9af76cab0212",
                        "source_entry_id": "a9fd363c-3a5b-369a-a15c-4c7c1d70485f",
                        "source_sense_id": "629aa924-8806-33a5-a5f8-bd58c433c61c",
                        "target_lang_word": "superprofit",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "superprofit",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3b672381-439b-3cb6-b070-b2607224b69e",
                                        "entry_id": "b9dc5ae9-91a9-306e-a448-b96caeca2278",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Profit dépassant la normale."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Économie"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3cdd318-c625-4c83-a35d-4799207d4376",
                                                "sense_id": "3b672381-439b-3cb6-b070-b2607224b69e",
                                                "text": "Il s’agit de mettre un terme aux superprofits dont bénéficient actuellement les cigarettiers en sacrifiant la santé et les finances publiques des Français."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d071e599-df33-4113-94f7-8325526afe01",
                                                "sense_id": "3b672381-439b-3cb6-b070-b2607224b69e",
                                                "text": "Le patron de Total s’est également efforcé de déminer les critiques récurrentes sur les bénéfices du groupe en opposant «les fantasmes» des «superprofits» ou les «profits insolents de Total» à la «réalité» de ses investissements."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1cf28c2-43b4-4722-9536-550b15193b7d",
                                                "sense_id": "3b672381-439b-3cb6-b070-b2607224b69e",
                                                "text": "\"En plus, beaucoup d’États veulent emboîter le pas à l’Australie, qui prépare une taxation des superprofits des entreprises minières, poursuit-il."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
